	(text "MAIN BUS BREAKER - TPS48111-Q1 smart high-side driver between the battery (VBAT_IN, J1) and the motor bus (VBUS)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "c9a7944a-5cb2-5711-910c-c6c02718dd8d")
	)
	(text "Back-to-back Q801/Q802 (common source): bidirectional when on (regen reaches the battery), blocks both ways when off. Logic supply (F1) taps VBAT_IN before the breaker, so the ESP32 and brakes stay powered when the bus trips."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 28 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "e8a15dd0-3af9-59e0-8838-8f1405475d49")
	)
	(text "Start-up (firmware): BUS_EN=0, PRECHG_EN=1 -> Q803 + R803/R804 (20 R) charge ~1 mF of ESC bulk capacitance through the Q802 body diode (tau ~20 ms); after ~150 ms BUS_EN=1, then PRECHG_EN=0."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 33 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "bb9ae01e-4339-5696-b2e7-b2297c48551a")
	)
	(text "Protection (TPS4811 SLUSEE5E eq. 6/7/9/11/13): RSNS 0.5 mOhm, RSET 100 R. IOC = 80 A (R815 30.1k, blank tOC = 5 ms with C804 330 nF, auto-retry ~7.5 s). ISC = 150 A (R816 4.32k, trips in 1.2 us). IMON gain 61.2 (R813 6.8k): 30.6 mV/A -> 1.84 V at 60 A."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 38 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "eca41a8e-c1e8-532a-969e-dd1b5005d21c")
	)
	(text "UVLO: 28 V rising (R806 470k / R807 20.5k, 1.18 V threshold). Faults FLT_I/FLT_T open drain -> BUS_FLT_N (ESP32). INP/INP_G have internal pull-downs: bus is OFF while the ESP32 is in reset."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 43 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "c3e4ef67-c6de-5bbc-8da4-34e174f56536")
	)
	(text "NOTE: VS/CS+/ISCP are rated -1 V: a reversed battery still damages U801, but Q801/Q802 keep reverse voltage off the ESC side. Keep the external 80 A fuse."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 48 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "f32f0499-c4d0-5df2-9377-29729e006926")
	)
